\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 THE LANDLORD GETS FIRED \'97 VIDEO GENERATION PROMPT\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 FORMAT
\f1\b0 \
10-second vertical sitcom video, 9:16 aspect ratio, high-quality stylized 3D animated-film aesthetic.\

\f0\b STORYBOARD REFERENCE
\f1\b0 \
Use the attached 
\f2\fs26 Storyboard.png
\f1\fs24  as the visual sequence reference. Follow the nine panels in reading order, left to right and top to bottom. Interpret them as consecutive moments in one continuous scene, not as a comic grid or split-screen layout. Preserve the established action sequence, dialogue timing, character interactions, and final comedic payoff.\

\f0\b CHARACTER IDENTITY AND CONSISTENCY
\f1\b0 \
Aeri is a very small sable Pomeranian with a rounded fluffy face, short muzzle, tiny black nose, round dark eyes, small triangular ears, short legs, a compact body, and abundant fluffy double-layered fur. The coat has a warm cream and golden-beige base naturally blended with tan and brown, with darker sable and gray-brown shading around the crown and ears.\
Preserve Aeri's recognizable canine anatomy, facial proportions, coat pattern, body size, and fluffy silhouette throughout every shot. Aeri wears the same miniature dark business suit and red tie in every scene.\
The owner is the same adult woman throughout the video, wearing a cream cardigan and casual jeans, with consistent facial features, hairstyle, body proportions, and wardrobe. Render her in the same stylized 3D animated world as Aeri.\
Do not redesign either character or introduce unintended changes in appearance between shots.\

\f0\b VISUAL STYLE \'97 HIGH-QUALITY STYLIZED 3D ANIMATED SITCOM
\f1\b0 \
Create a polished, high-quality stylized 3D animated-film scene with appealing character design, rounded forms, soft and detailed fluffy fur, expressive eyes, refined materials, cinematic composition, warm naturalistic lighting, and subtle depth of field.\
Aeri must look like a carefully crafted 3D animated sable Pomeranian, preserving the established character identity. Maintain the rounded face, short muzzle, compact body, short legs, small triangular ears, and abundant cream-and-golden-beige fur naturally blended with darker sable shading.\
The woman and Aeri must belong to the same coherent 3D animated world, with consistent rendering, material quality, proportions, lighting, and facial design.\
Use naturalistic lighting and convincing physical interactions while retaining the unmistakable appearance of stylized 3D animation. Fur should have fine individual strands and soft volume. Fabrics, paper, wood, and upholstery should have refined material detail without appearing like real live-action footage.\
The comedy comes from the contrast between Aeri's small, fluffy appearance and the dog's stern, authoritative corporate-manager behavior. Use expressive but controlled facial animation and readable reactions without distorting the characters' anatomy.\

\f0\b SETTING AND PROPS
\f1\b0 \
A cozy home office connected to a living room. The office contains a wooden desk, an executive-style chair, a performance review document, an empty dog-food bowl, and a leash. A comfortable sofa is visible in the adjacent living area.\
Maintain consistent room layout, furniture placement, lighting direction, object scale, and spatial relationships throughout the sequence. Keep the sofa clearly reachable from the desk.\

\f0\b ACTION AND TIMING
\f1\b0 \

\f0\b 0.0\'961.8 seconds \'97 Performance review
\f1\b0 \
Medium shot of Aeri sitting behind the desk, facing the owner. Aeri slides a performance review document toward her with a front paw, maintaining a stern, authoritative expression.\
Aeri says in a dry, professional tone:\
\'93We need to talk about your performance.\'94\

\f0\b 1.8\'963.0 seconds \'97 Defensive response
\f1\b0 \
Cut to a medium close-up of the owner leaning toward the desk. She gestures defensively toward Aeri, visibly offended by the accusation.\
The owner replies:\
\'93I feed you every day!\'94\

\f0\b 3.0\'964.5 seconds \'97 Evidence presented
\f1\b0 \
Cut back to Aeri. Aeri indicates the empty food bowl and the leash on the desk, presenting them as evidence of inadequate service. Use deliberate, controlled front-paw movements and a completely unimpressed expression.\
No dialogue during this action.\

\f0\b 4.5\'965.4 seconds \'97 Disbelief
\f1\b0 \
Close-up of the owner's face as her expression changes from indignation to stunned disbelief. Her eyes widen and her mouth opens slightly.\
The owner says:\
\'93What?!\'94\

\f0\b 5.4\'966.8 seconds \'97 Termination
\f1\b0 \
Medium close-up of Aeri calmly pushing the termination notice across the desk toward the owner. The document clearly communicates that the owner is being fired.\
Aeri says in a cold, matter-of-fact tone:\
\'93You're terminated.\'94\

\f0\b 6.8\'967.4 seconds \'97 Reaction
\f1\b0 \
The owner looks down at the notice, stunned and speechless. Hold briefly on her reaction to allow the joke to register.\

\f0\b 7.4\'968.1 seconds \'97 Climbing down
\f1\b0 \
Show Aeri turning toward the edge of the desk, carefully climbing down, and landing on the floor. The descent must be physically plausible for a very small dog. Preserve the desk height, floor position, and direction of travel.\

\f0\b 8.1\'969.0 seconds \'97 Crossing to the sofa
\f1\b0 \
Use a wider, floor-level shot to show Aeri walking across the floor toward the nearby sofa. The movement must connect directly to the preceding descent. Keep the dog's direction, scale, and position consistent.\

\f0\b 9.0\'9610.0 seconds \'97 Final payoff
\f1\b0 \
Aeri reaches the sofa, climbs onto the cushion, and settles comfortably in the center as if claiming the executive's seat. Aeri looks quietly satisfied.\
The owner remains beside the desk, holding the termination notice and staring at Aeri in disbelief.\
End on a clear composition showing Aeri comfortably occupying the sofa while the owner remains standing and powerless. The final image must communicate the reversal of authority immediately.\

